.SH OPTIONS
\f[B]\-\-batch\f[R]
.RS
.PP
Specify a batch of commands to execute.
.TP
Example:
\f[B]hyprctl\f[R] \f[I]\-\-batch \(dqeval hl.config({ general = {
border_size = 2 } }) ; eval hl.config({ general = { gaps_out = 20 }
})\(dq\f[R]
.RS
.PP
\f[I];\f[R] separates the commands.
.RE
.RE
